<title>CANADA: Firan Corp announces sale of U.S division.</title>
<headline>Firan Corp announces sale of U.S division.</headline>
<dateline>OAKVILLE, Ontario 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Firan Corp said on Tuesday that it will sell certain assets of its U.S.-based motor coach division to Forest River Inc for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>&quot;With the sale, Firan Corp is in a better position to manage and finance a portfolio of businesses with growth and profit potential,&quot; Firan said.</p>
<p>The company said the sale would increase capacity and add jobs at the facility in Elkhart, Indiana. Firan produces recreational vehicles and air traffic control components.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto (416) 941-8100</p>
